    "We hope the experience was great — and the printed book turns out even better." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir hoffen, es hat Spaß gemacht – und das gedruckte Buch wird noch schöner."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We hope the experience was great — and the printed book turns out even better."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esperamos que la experiencia haya sido genial, y que el libro impreso quede aún mejor."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nous espérons que l’expérience t’a plu — et que le livre imprimé sera encore mieux."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Speriamo che l’esperienza ti sia piaciuta — e che il libro stampato venga ancora meglio."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "制作の時間が楽しいものだったなら、そして刷り上がった本がもっと素敵になりますように。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "즐거운 작업이었길, 그리고 인쇄된 책은 더 멋지게 나오길 바랍니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esperamos que a experiência tenha sido ótima — e que o livro impresso fique ainda melhor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "希望这次制作过程很愉快——印出来的书会更棒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We’d love to see your printed books, including commercial projects. Share photos and the story behind your book in GitHub Discussions." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wir würden deine gedruckten Bücher gern sehen, auch kommerzielle Projekte. Teile Fotos und die Geschichte hinter deinem Buch in den GitHub Discussions."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We’d love to see your printed books, including commercial projects. Share photos and the story behind your book in GitHub Discussions."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nos encantaría ver tus libros impresos, también proyectos comerciales. Comparte fotos y la historia de tu libro en GitHub Discussions."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nous adorerions voir vos livres imprimés, y compris vos projets commerciaux. Partagez des photos et l’histoire de votre livre dans GitHub Discussions."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ci piacerebbe vedere i tuoi libri stampati, anche i progetti commerciali. Condividi foto e la storia del tuo libro su GitHub Discussions."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "商用プロジェクトも含め、印刷したブックをぜひ見せてください。写真とブックにまつわるストーリーを GitHub Discussions で共有しましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "상업 프로젝트를 포함해 인쇄한 책을 보고 싶어요. GitHub Discussions에서 사진과 책에 담긴 이야기를 공유해 주세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adoraríamos ver seus livros impressos, inclusive projetos comerciais. Compartilhe fotos e a história do seu livro no GitHub Discussions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我们很想看看你印好的照片书，包括商业项目。欢迎在 GitHub Discussions 分享照片和书背后的故事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What worked well? What could be better? Share your feedback and ideas on GitHub Discussions." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Was hat gut funktioniert? Was könnte besser sein? Teile dein Feedback und deine Ideen in den GitHub Discussions."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What worked well? What could be better? Share your feedback and ideas on GitHub Discussions."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Qué funcionó bien? ¿Qué podría mejorar? Comparte tu opinión e ideas en GitHub Discussions."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qu’est-ce qui a bien marché ? Qu’est-ce qui pourrait être amélioré ? Partagez vos avis et idées dans GitHub Discussions."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cosa ha funzionato bene? Cosa si potrebbe migliorare? Condividi feedback e idee su GitHub Discussions."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "良かった点、改善できる点は？フィードバックやアイデアを GitHub Discussions で共有してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "무엇이 좋았나요? 무엇을 개선할 수 있을까요? GitHub Discussions에서 피드백과 아이디어를 공유해 주세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O que funcionou bem? O que poderia melhorar? Compartilhe seu feedback e ideias no GitHub Discussions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "哪些地方好用？哪些可以改进？欢迎在 GitHub Discussions 分享你的反馈和想法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What worked well? What could be better? We’d love your feedback." : {
